<title>FRANCE: S.T. Dupont profit rises sharply.</title>
<headline>S.T. Dupont profit rises sharply.</headline>
<dateline>PARIS 1997-06-23</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year to March 31, 1997</p>
<p>(Figures in millions of French francs unless stated)</p>
<p>    Net attributable			    37.9  vs	    18.7</p>
<p>    Net attributable per share (francs)   6.21  vs	    3.06</p>
<p>    Operating				     40.0  vs	    16.2</p>
<p>    Turnover				     572.2  vs	   578.5</p>
<p>NOTE - Luxury accessories firm S.T. Dupont gave its 1996/97 results in a statement.</p>
<p>It said it was confident that it would show another profit increase for 1997/98.</p>
<p>-- Paris Newsroom +33 1 4221 5452</p>
</text>
